{"summary":"Help Snail Bob solve all puzzles and avoid all obstacles during his adventure","description":"Snail Bob needs your help again!  \n\nAs in the original game Snail Bob simply crawls onwards regardless of the situation. And your job is to press buttons, switch levers, move platforms and activate other machines to not give Bob to perish or be gobbled during his adventure.\n\nThis is a good and funny game, which makes rack your brain but won't break it and definitely makes you smile\n\nFEATURES:\n- 120 levels spread across 4 unique worlds\n- Dressing Bob in tons of different outfits and hats (you can even dress up him in Pixel, After Shower and Dragon costumes)\n- Find all hidden stars and jigsaw pieces (many hidden objects on levels)\n- Sequel of the famous web game that has been played over a billion times!\n\nMANY DIFFERENT LOCATIONS TO PLAY:\n- Egypt , Space , Forest , Castle , Island , Winter\n\nADDITIONAL FEATURES:\n- Free puzzle game\n- Adventure game\n- Funny Snail character\n \nIf you faced any issue or you want to give us your feedback, please write us sb2.ask@gmail.com","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nOpJH6Irg9k?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hZLj-V_ks-l3E1ZMmJ5m1j0Nltf_0BN8QrLQFOqrKYe-5MxWzeJpaMN0gB2yCV4FbBacy2RDlbjc7NwSAnbDww","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C5IDf3LnJFrxD5lOzbqd0-VeBk3A469G1LNA-xvalgE4Tz5eIy2tu0aCz0c8iugkufu2eapbUzakYueHgNcA1w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zP7_PAGcMAz-o38FAlmxYv7KDBWfqHPKpzYGJQ_P9p9yVvlsShEaPI91TnsTm9I560KuuHPnTttJ8atDp3rA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CBxVpREV95n77bvEeaBZmBBQUFJXHoZ4dtnsLK_ZgtEU4VBUVRsxt70KTspF80f28XCID8DqJAXC1Q9bDpII","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/n99uCP6U8yIl2P8-MWlPQMyz-ppORvTk8FxFXIkbP96p2xgfcwnZIhbhZdPr5rxNshMjz0w7jOEOZ2eLpiDLzQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bFWSxSEdk_VX1qgblQU55-8aKeXpt9FpJWGIna7ni